Fixed. The bug was the `break` inside the loop at `src/url_utils.ts:14` — it exited after stripping the first matching tracking param, so only one of multiple tracking params (e.g. `utm_source` + `fbclid`) got removed. Removing `break` lets the loop strip every present `TRACKING_PARAMS` entry. No other code references `url_utils`, so nothing else depends on that behavior.


